{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83c\udfae Game Overview </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Elf Clash is a thrilling real-time strategy battler where strategic cardplay leads to victory. Combine cards, unleash skills, and outsmart your opponents in a dynamic battlefield where every decision counts. The unique projectile collision system ensures no two battles are ever the same, adding layers of unexpected depth and excitement to each encounter.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u2728 Key Features</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3649910/extras/94b479f1ec543644514f2e6a14f68848.poster.avif?t=1761650410\" width=1170 height=382 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3649910/extras/94b479f1ec543644514f2e6a14f68848.webm?t=1761650410\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3649910/extras/94b479f1ec543644514f2e6a14f68848.mp4?t=1761650410\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u2219Dynamic Projectile Physics: Watch as spells and attacks collide mid-air, altering their trajectories in real-time. Adapt your tactics on the fly\u2014victory favors the quick-witted, not just the strong. </strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u2219Endless Strategic Combinations: Master a diverse arsenal of skills, from defensive setups like Light Barrier, Cyclone, and Time Stop to aggressive tactics such as Multi-Shot and Elemental Magic. Design your own unique playstyle.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3649910/extras/908d3fd84916191162eabe23c54cbacd.poster.avif?t=1761650410\" width=1170 height=382 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3649910/extras/908d3fd84916191162eabe23c54cbacd.webm?t=1761650410\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3649910/extras/908d3fd84916191162eabe23c54cbacd.mp4?t=1761650410\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><strong> </strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u2219Build Your Dream Team: Recruit powerful heroes, each with unique abilities. Discover synergistic team compositions and unlock powerful combo effects through clever hero pairing. </strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u2219Escalating Intensity: As you progress and your heroes level up, battles grow more intense\u2014projectiles multiply, collisions intensify, and the action reaches explosive new heights.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83c\udfc6 Demo Version Content</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3649910/extras/13f6519cac667522048f9ef8710bd83f.avif?t=1761650410\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3649910/extras_big/13f6519cac667522048f9ef8710bd83f.avif?t=1761650410 width=1560 height=508 /></span> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Jump into the action-packed Demo, already packed with content: </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u221925 Challenging Stages across 7 distinct environments. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u221910+ Playable Heroes, each with unique skills and 3-tier skin evolution paths. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u221920+ Skill Cards to experiment with, spanning Attack, Defense, Magic, and Healing roles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83d\uddfa\ufe0f Development Roadmap </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2219Version 1.0 (2025): 20 heroes, 50 skill cards, and ~105 stages. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2219Free Update (Early 2026): Additional heroes, cards, stages, and more content. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2219Free Update (Late 2026): Online PvP mode\u2014challenge players worldwide. </p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3649910?t=1761650410","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3649910?t=1761650410","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3649910/ca8e2711015d11afb3e50e91c69c12b80833ad11/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1761650410","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3649910/ca8e2711015d11afb3e50e91c69c12b80833ad11/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1761650410","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":3913210,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83c\udfae Game Overview </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Elf Clash is a thrilling real-time strategy battler where strategic cardplay leads to victory. Combine cards, unleash skills, and outsmart your opponents in a dynamic battlefield where every decision counts. The unique projectile collision system ensures no two battles are ever the same, adding layers of unexpected depth and excitement to each encounter.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u2728 Key Features</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3649910/extras/94b479f1ec543644514f2e6a14f68848.poster.avif?t=1761650410\" width=1170 height=382 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3649910/extras/94b479f1ec543644514f2e6a14f68848.webm?t=1761650410\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamsta